              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyi e milimo bakalabomba mwi Tenti Lyakukumaninamo aba mu ndupwa shakwa Geshoni. Itama mwana shimapepo Aroni ewakulabangalila mu milimo yabo.”",
          "type": "text",
